# purpose: part B of the replay pair. Every line depends on state that must have survived the
#          restart: balances, bob frozen, carol closed, and the next sequence number being 16.
BALANCE alice
BALANCE bob
BALANCE dave
DEPOSIT bob 1
DEPOSIT carol 1
OPEN alice USD
OPEN carol GBP
DEPOSIT alice 5
UNFREEZE bob
WITHDRAW bob 199.5
CLOSE bob
WITHDRAW alice 65
WITHDRAW alice 0.01
OPEN erin EUR
DEPOSIT erin 1
BALANCE erin
